WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 line:88%
Two agents work on separate files; one asks the coordinator a question.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:88%
The coordinator chooses “there” for blank names, and work continues.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000 line:88%
